WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.557 --> 00:00:01.390
(gentle upbeat music)

00:00:01.390 --> 00:00:06.390
♪ I need a do-over, how
did we end up this way ♪

00:00:07.391 --> 00:00:12.391
♪ I'm so confused, lover,
did I mistake love and pain ♪

00:00:13.472 --> 00:00:18.472
♪ Ain't got no shine
left, I couldn't hide it ♪

00:00:19.548 --> 00:00:24.548
♪ I almost lost all my light ♪

00:00:24.573 --> 00:00:29.573
♪ And I didn't choose sober,
but my eyes can't look away ♪

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:37.074
♪ I see our true colors, lately,
we've been lookin' gray ♪

00:00:38.186 --> 00:00:43.186
♪ I can't turn back now, 'cause
you'd take me back down ♪

00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:49.305
♪ That road that always seems
to come right back around ♪

00:00:50.018 --> 00:00:53.134
♪ Remember when ♪

00:00:53.134 --> 00:00:55.933
♪ We had dreams to fly away ♪

00:00:55.933 --> 00:00:59.017
♪ But that was then ♪

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:02.976
♪ And now our story's just a page ♪

00:01:02.976 --> 00:01:07.018
♪ Like a chill in my
bones when you say to me ♪

00:01:07.018 --> 00:01:09.007
♪ What you say to me ♪

00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:13.165
♪ I thought I found home,
but hidden underneath ♪

00:01:13.165 --> 00:01:15.022
♪ We were crumblin' ♪

00:01:15.022 --> 00:01:20.000
♪ No shootin' stars can
fix what we aren't ♪

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
♪ And what good's a lighthouse
when the light is burnin' out ♪

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:30.106
♪ And I feel what we
were washin' over me ♪

00:01:30.106 --> 00:01:33.403
♪ Questionin' everything all that time ♪

00:01:33.403 --> 00:01:36.248
♪ And I keep all the
ways that you wanted me ♪

00:01:36.248 --> 00:01:39.660
♪ To be different fresh in my mind ♪

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:41.277
♪ What you loved, what you wanted ♪

00:01:41.277 --> 00:01:45.693
♪ What you held so high when
we first met in hindsight ♪

00:01:45.693 --> 00:01:49.730
♪ Were the things that you
tried and asked me to change ♪

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:53.448
♪ As if I could do that ♪

00:01:53.448 --> 00:01:57.878
♪ Like a wave, you're
always crashin' into me ♪

00:01:57.878 --> 00:01:59.819
♪ Crashin' into me ♪

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:03.907
♪ And these days are harder
than they used to be ♪

00:02:03.907 --> 00:02:05.898
♪ And they used to be ♪

00:02:05.898 --> 00:02:10.865
♪ No shootin' stars can
fix what we aren't ♪

00:02:10.865 --> 00:02:15.865
♪ And what good's a lighthouse
when the light is burnin' out ♪

00:02:21.462 --> 00:02:23.513
(audience cheering)

